    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI sales assistant for a digital services company.\n\nAnalyze the following customer lead:\n\nName: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json['Full Name'] }}\nCompany: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json['Company Name'] }}\nService: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json['Service'] }}\nBudget: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json['Budget'] }}\nProject Details: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json['Project Details'] }}\n\nYour tasks:\n1. Classify the lead as Hot, Warm, or Cold.\n2. Assign a lead score from 0 to 100.\n3. Write a short explanation of the score.\n4. Recommend the next sales action.\n\nScoring guidance:\n- Hot: 75-100, clear need, strong buying signals, and suitable budget.\n- Warm: 40-74, some interest but missing important details.\n- Cold: 0-39, vague requirements or low purchase intent.\n- Do not assume missing information is confirmed.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this format:\n{\n  \"lead_category\": \"Hot\",\n  \"lead_score\": 85,\n  \"reason\": \"Clear project requirements and suitable budget.\",\n  \"next_action\": \"Arrange a consultation call.\"\n}\n\nDo not include markdown or code fences.",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
